<div class="page-head"><div><a class="back-link" href="/">‹ Brief</a><p class="eyebrow">Cross-domain operations evidence</p><h1><%= review.coverageErrors.length ? 'Operations review is incomplete' : 'Operations briefing' %></h1><p class="lede">History for <%= review.window.from %> through <%= review.window.to %>. Pending work and exceptions are current, not historical snapshots.</p></div></div>
<form class="form-inline" method="get" action="/foundry/briefing"><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Briefing from</span><input class="input" type="date" name="from" value="<%= review.window.from %>" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Briefing through</span><input class="input" type="date" name="to" value="<%= review.window.to %>" required></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Update briefing</button></form>
<p class="hint">Calendar boundaries use <%= review.window.timezone %>. Financial records use payment/posting dates; operational records use their event timestamps. Generated <%= review.generatedAt %>.</p>
<div class="notice"><div><strong>This is a review, not an execution.</strong><p><%= review.sourceNotice %></p><p>Human-recorded business events are not presented as work StockChief performed. Multiple records can describe one action; source counts are evidence counts, not additional actions or units moved.</p></div></div>
<% if (review.coverageErrors.length) { %><div class="notice notice--warning" role="alert"><div><strong>Do not treat this as an all-clear.</strong><p>Could not check: <%= review.coverageErrors.join(', ') %>. Successful sources are still listed.</p></div></div><% } %>
<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>Coverage and complete source counts</h2></div><div class="card-body"><% review.sources.forEach(function(source) { %><p><strong><%= source.name %></strong>: <%= source.complete ? source.count + ' records' : 'unavailable — review incomplete' %></p><% }) %><p>Supplier documents, incoming mailbox capture, recipient delivery and external bank/accounting reconciliation are not independently verified by this report. Zero records in a source does not certify a working connection.</p></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>Recorded outcomes and business events</h2></div><div class="card-body"><% if (!review.events.length) { %><p>No recorded events from successfully checked sources in this window.</p><% } %><% review.events.forEach(function(event) { %><article class="fold-note" data-domain="<%= event.domain %>"><strong><a href="<%= event.href %>"><%= event.title %></a></strong><p><%= event.detail %></p><p class="hint"><%= event.domain %> · <%= event.at %> · source <%= event.id %><%= event.actorId ? ' · recorded actor ' + event.actorId : '' %><%= event.verifiedWork ? ' · verified StockChief work' : '' %></p><% if (event.amountMinor !== null) { %><p><%= helpers.money(event.amountMinor, event.currency) %></p><% } %></article><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>Pending work now · <%= review.pending.length %></h2></div><div class="card-body"><% if (!review.pending.length) { %><p>No pending work-item records. This does not say every business workflow has been implemented or completed.</p><% } %><% review.pending.forEach(function(item) { %><p><a href="/autopilot/work/<%= item.id %>"><%= String(item.category).replaceAll('_', ' ') %></a> · <%= item.execution_status.replaceAll('_', ' ').toLowerCase() %></p><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>Exceptions now · <%= review.exceptions.length %></h2><a href="/needs-you/all">All decisions</a></div><div class="card-body"><% if (!review.exceptions.length) { %><p><%= review.coverageErrors.length ? 'No known decisions from successful sources; the review is incomplete.' : 'No current decisions reported by the checked exception sources.' %></p><% } %><% review.exceptions.forEach(function(item) { %><article class="fold-note"><strong><a href="<%= item.href %>"><%= item.title %></a></strong><p><%= item.happened %></p><p><%= item.recommendation %></p></article><% }) %></div></section>
